---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: de
title: Public Thinking
description: Forschungsergebnisse, Executive One-Pager, Case Studies und Feldnotizen — live, nicht als statisches Portfolio.
permalink: /de/public-thinking/
extraHead:
  - "<link rel='alternate' hreflang='de' href='https://communitygeeks.ai/de/public-thinking/'><link rel='alternate' hreflang='en' href='https://communitygeeks.ai/public-thinking/'><link rel='alternate' hreflang='x-default' href='https://communitygeeks.ai/public-thinking/'>"
extraScripts:
  - "public-thinking-filter.js"
closingCta:
  secondaryLabel: "See how we work →"
  secondaryUrl: "/approach/"
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-hero-row">
      <div class="page-eyebrow">
        {% include "partials/node-mark.njk" %}
        Public Thinking
      </div>
      <div class="pt-lang-switch">
        <a href="/public-thinking/">EN</a> <span class="active">DE</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h1 class="page-title">Laufende Erkenntnisse, kein statisches Portfolio.</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">Forschungsergebnisse, Executive One-Pager, Case Studies und Feldnotizen, im jeweils passenden Format. Jedes Stück ist nach Format und danach gekennzeichnet, wie viel Evidenz die Aussage aktuell trägt.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="filter-bar">
    <button class="filter-pill active" data-filter="all">Alle</button>
    <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="research">Forschungsergebnisse</button>
    <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="onepager">Executive One-Pager</button>
    <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="case">Case Studies</button>
    <button class="filter-pill" data-filter="field">Feldnotizen</button>
  </div>

  <ul class="pt-index-list">
    {% for piece in publicThinkingDe %}
    <li class="pt-index-row" data-type="{{ piece.filterType }}">
      <a href="{{ piece.url }}">
        <span class="pt-index-title">{{ piece.title }}</span>
        {% if piece.deck %}<span class="pt-index-deck">{{ piece.deck }}</span>{% endif %}
        <span class="pt-index-meta">
          <span>{{ piece.format }}</span>
          <span>{{ piece.date | readableDate("de") }}</span>
          <span class="confidence-tag">{{ piece.confidence }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="pt-index-empty" data-type="research">Weitere Forschungsergebnisse sind in Arbeit und erscheinen hier, sobald sie das Review durchlaufen haben.</div>
</div>
